abstract: "A documented pre-release research-code archive for apricot-production forecasting. Includes original scripts and saved analyses, a reconstructed nested CV script with partially verified outer folds, and a reconstructed spring-temperature sensitivity script verified against eight archived result CSV files. Original meteorological data and source Excel workbooks are not distributed."
